  "description": "Yeogyeong Ju is the heiress to Taeheung, a major corporation, and its youngest-ever executive. But beneath it all lies a secret: because of a genetic condition, her physical age changes whenever it rains. To protect herself, she has spent years avoiding unnecessary social interactions, until Gwanyeong Seo, Taeheung’s newest executive, begins seeking her out. His warmth is unlike anything she has known, and despite her attempts to push him away, she finds herself slowly letting him in. How long can she keep the truth from the one person stubbornly determined to get to know her?\n\n_Source: Tapptoon_",
